<title>USA: 3DX Technologies names Randall as CFO.</title>
<headline>3DX Technologies names Randall as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>3DX Technologies Inc said Thursday it had appointed Randall Keys as chief financial officer of the company.  </p>
<p>A company official said Keys, whose appointment was effective April 1, was filling a position left vacant by Ben Roberts, who resigned last August.</p>
<p>Keys was treasurer for Norcen Explorer Inc in Houston before accepting the new post, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>3DX is an oil and gas exploration company.</p>
